<title>UK: BA offers to meet Florida attorney general.</title>
<headline>BA offers to meet Florida attorney general.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Airways Plc said on Thursday it had offered to meet Florida Attorney-General Bob Butterworth about its dispute with Laker Airway Inc.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it would inform the attorney-general about the &quot;lack of substance&quot; to Laker's claims and that it intends to try and dismiss the complaints in court next week.</p>
</text>
